\f0\b \cf2 What makes crypto unique (vs. equities)
\f1\b0 \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  1. 
\f0\b 24/7 market
\f1\b0  \'97 no opening/closing prints, but session bias matters (Asia accumulation, London expansion, NY manipulation/reversal is the classic SMC playbook).\
  2. 
\f0\b Leveraged perp futures dominate price discovery
\f1\b0  \'97 open interest, funding rate, and liquidation cascades are leading indicators, not lagging.\
  3. 
\f0\b Round numbers + psychological levels are real magnets
\f1\b0  ($90K, $95K, $100K BTC). Equities don't trade like this.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  4. 
\f0\b No earnings, no fundamentals in the daily timeframe
\f1\b0  \'97 pure liquidity + flow + structure. ICT/SMC concepts (orderblocks, FVGs, liquidity sweeps) actually work better here than on equities because there's no fundamental "noise" to dilute the structural read.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  5. 
\f0\b Crypto-adjacent equities (COIN, MSTR, MARA, RIOT, HOOD) trade beta to BTC
\f1\b0  \'97 but with US-market hours, gaps, and equity-style mean reversion. That's a 
\f2\i separate
\f1\i0  tradable layer.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  
\f0\b Tradable concepts to surface in the tab
\f1\b0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  
\f0\b A. Orderblocks (the headliner)
\f1\b0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  For BTC and ETH, identify the last 
\f0\b down-candle before a major up-move
\f1\b0  (bullish OB) and 
\f0\b up-candle before a major down-move
\f1\b0  (bearish OB) on 4H and Daily.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               \
  - Display: price range of OB, distance from current price, age (how many bars since formed), "freshness" (untested = high probability, tested = used up).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
  - Trade rule: limit buy at bullish OB top, stop below OB low, target = liquidity pool / FVG / next OB.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
  
\f0\b B. Fair Value Gaps (FVGs / Imbalances)
\f1\b0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
  Three-candle pattern where wick of candle 1 and wick of candle 3 don't overlap \'97 price tends to return to fill.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       \
  - Display: open FVGs in last 50 bars, % filled, expected fill timeframe.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \
  - Trade rule: fade into unfilled FVGs in trending market.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
  
\f0\b C. Liquidity map (this is the killer feature)
\f1\b0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
  Where are stop-losses clustered?                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
  - 
\f0\b Equal highs/lows
\f1\b0  = engineered liquidity (price will sweep these).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  - 
\f0\b Round numbers
\f1\b0  = retail stops cluster ($95K BTC, $3.5K ETH).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         \
  - 
\f0\b Recent daily high/low
\f1\b0  = intraday traders' stops.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  \
  - 
\f0\b OI-derived liq levels
\f1\b0  \'97 Coinglass-style liquidation heatmap (free API or scrape).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
  Display as horizontal lines on a price ladder with $ amount of stops sitting there. 
\f2\i "$420M longs liquidated at $91,200"
\f1\i0  is a magnet, not a barrier.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  
\f0\b D. Funding rate as contrarian signal
\f1\b0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  - Funding > +0.05% / 8h on Binance perps = crowded long \uc0\u8594  fade with short bias.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       \
  - Funding < -0.02% = crowded short \uc0\u8594  squeeze setup.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  - Display: 8h funding, 7-day avg, percentile rank.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
  
\f0\b E. Session bias
\f1\b0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  - 
\f0\b Asia session (6pm\'962am PT):
\f1\b0  accumulation, low volatility.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \
  - 
\f0\b London open (12am PT):
\f1\b0  first expansion move, often the "judas swing" (false move that reverses).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \
  - 
\f0\b NY open (6:30am PT):
\f1\b0  real direction set, biggest liquidity sweeps happen here.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
  - Display: which session we're in, what the session has done so far vs. its typical range.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  
\f0\b F. BTC dominance + alt season indicator
\f1\b0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  - BTC.D rising \uc0\u8594  BTC strength, alts bleed \u8594  don't trade alts long.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \
  - BTC.D falling + BTC sideways \uc0\u8594  alt season \u8594  rotate to ETH/SOL/large caps.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  
\f0\b G. Crypto-equity beta plays (the cross-asset edge)
\f1\b0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
  When BTC is in a clean trend but you don't want crypto exposure:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
  - 
\f0\b COIN
\f1\b0  = 2\'d7 BTC beta, US hours, normal liquidity, options chain.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
  - 
\f0\b MSTR
\f1\b0  = 3\'964\'d7 BTC beta (leveraged via convertible debt).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              \
  - 
\f0\b MARA / RIOT
\f1\b0  = miners, beta + electricity/hashrate idiosyncratic risk.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \
  - 
\f0\b IBIT / FBTC
\f1\b0  = direct ETF, 1\'d7 BTC, cleanest exposure.                 \
 
